  "interpretation": "<ul data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1453\">\n<li data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1259\">\n<p data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1259\"><strong data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1182\">\"Not Detected\"</strong> means no opportunistic enteric parasites were found in the submitted sample.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1260\" data-end=\"1399\">\n<p data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1399\">Positive findings should be <strong data-start=\"1290\" data-end=\"1315\">clinically correlated</strong>, especially in <strong data-start=\"1331\" data-end=\"1361\">immunocompromised patients</strong> (HIV/AIDS, transplant, chemotherapy).</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1400\" data-end=\"1453\">\n<p data-start=\"1402\" data-end=\"1453\">Repeat testing may be required if symptoms persist.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
